OL,3,CMan arrested over death of girl, 9,
OL,4,Cfound injured on industrial estate
OL,6,FPolice in Scotland have arrested a man
OL,7,Fover the death of a girl found injured
OL,8,Fon an industrial estate.
OL,10,FThe nine-year-old girl from West
OL,11,FYorkshire died after she was
OL,12,Fdiscovered at Elliot Industrial Estate
OL,13,Fin Arbroath shortly after midnight in
OL,14,Fthe early hours of Monday.
OL,16,FShe was taken to Ninewells Hospital in
OL,17,FDundee but was sadly pronounced dead.
OL,19,FA 35-year-old man, who police said was
OL,20,Fknown to the child, has since been
OL,21,Farrested in connection with her death.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G1/4
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
