FL,334,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F333A1785865786
OL,3,CMan arrested over death of girl, 9,
OL,4,Cfound injured on industrial estate
OL,6,FHe has been described as white British.
OL,8,FPolice Scotland said her family had
OL,9,Fbeen camping in the area at the time
OL,10,Fshe was found, adding that they were
OL,11,Fnot looking for anyone else in
OL,12,Fconnection with her death.
OL,14,FThe girl's family are currently being
OL,15,Fsupported by specialist officers.
OL,17,FA forensics tent and police cordon
OL,18,Fremained in place at the scene on
OL,19,FMonday, while flowers had been left at
OL,20,Fthe scene.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G2/4
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,334,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F333A1785865786
OL,3,CMan arrested over death of girl, 9,
OL,4,Cfound injured on industrial estate
OL,6,FSpeaking from the scene on Monday,
OL,7,FCllr Lois Speed said: I think
OL,8,Feveryone's just shocked. It's such a
OL,9,Fhorrific thing to read when you wake
OL,10,Fup in the morning as you're about to
OL,11,Fstart your day.
OL,13,F"I think everyone's just shocked and
OL,14,Fheartbroken. A loss of life of anyone
OL,15,Fis sad and tragic, but even more so
OL,16,Fwhen it's a child - a wee girl - only
OL,17,Fnine years old.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G3/4
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
