PN,33304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F333A1785865786
OL,3,CMan arrested over death of girl, 9,
OL,4,Cfound injured on industrial estate
OL,6,FDetective Inspector Mike Ness of the
OL,7,Fforce's Major Investigation Team said:
OL,8,F"Our thoughts remain with those
OL,9,Faffected by these events.
OL,11,F"Members of the public will see an
OL,12,Fincreased police presence and activity
OL,13,Fin the area as enquiries continue.
OL,15,F"This is intended to reassure the
OL,16,Fpublic and anyone who may have
OL,17,Finformation should approach these
OL,18,Fofficers or contact Police Scotland on
OL,19,F101, quoting incident number 0008 of
OL,20,FMonday, 3 August 2026."
OL,26,@pD@AOUsD@AOUwD@AOU|D@WO]
